Z||000003||Archie||01-15-2001||02:35 PM||||Thanks for the help guys.<P>The main web site is at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/</A> <P>The good info on what is included in the kits is at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/v8fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/v8fiero.htm</A> <P>An 18 page write up with some 80 photos showing a V-8 Fiero being put together is at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/v8install.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/v8install.htm</A> <P>A nice little write-up on helping you to choose an engine for your swap is at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/arch9.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/arch9.htm</A> <P>Another interesting write up on what we chagre to do the swap for you is at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/arch10.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/arch10.htm</A> <P>We even have an on line order form at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/cgi-bin/shop.cgi/page=list.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/cgi-bin/shop.cgi/page=list.html</A> <P>Once you've started your research you can always call me at 1-800-891-3608.<P>Thanks<P>Archie<P>Today we are working on this 330 HP 350HO engine going into that Red 86 GT.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mvc-525s.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||14
